-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("es",104,{
[3297]="70069887\n1\tTalk to Jaith outside Dâr Laja about opening the Meeting-hall\tDâr Laja, the Meeting-hall, is located in the centre of the Upper Ward.\n2\tDefeat Heirsworn in the Sail-haven until you find the keys to Dâr Laja\tJaith told you that Heirsworn in the Sail-haven might have absconded with the keys to Dâr Laja, and they must be recovered before the hall can safely be opened to the people.\n3\tDefeat Heirsworn in the Sail-haven until you find the keys to Dâr Laja\tJaith told you that Heirsworn in the Sail-haven might have absconded with the keys to Dâr Laja, and they must be recovered before the hall can safely be opened to the people.\n4\tBring the keys you recovered to Yamin just north of the Grand Market in the Upper Ward\tYamin is located just to the north of the Grand Market in the Upper Ward of Umbar Baharbêl.\n5\tTalk to Jaith outside Dâr Laja in the centre of the Upper Ward\tJaith guards the entrance to Dâr Laja, the Meeting-hall, in the centre of the Upper Ward.\n",
[3298]="7004E655\n1\tTalk to Bótuz Frostblood on the upper level of Skarháld\tBótuz Frostblood is on the upper level of Skarháld.\n2\tTalk to Bótuz Frostblood and join the search for Karazgar\tBótuz Frostblood is on the upper level of Skarháld, and he plans to lead a party of dwarves in search of the Weeping Warrior.\n3\tTalk to Bótuz Frostblood on the upper level of Skarháld\tBótuz Frostblood is on the upper level of Skarháld.\n",
[3299]="70059A78\n1\tDefeat wargs in Clovengap (total: 8)\030Investigate the old vineyard of Maranazhâr\030Investigate the sounds coming from Dashat-zahar\030Investigate the Angmarim presence at Garanashmar\tBósi has asked you to search a number of locations within Clovengap for the missing Black Stone Anvil, and to defeat the wargs charged with protecting the area from intruders.\n2\tTalk to Bósi in Clovengap\tBósi is at his camp not far from the south-western entrance to Clovengap.\n",
[3300]="7004E681\n1\tTalk to Durin inside Tharrazhâr, the keep of Skarháld\tDurin is inside Tharrazhâr, the keep of Skarháld.\n2\tTally the weapons stored inside the keep (total: 7)\030Tally the armour stored inside the keep (total: 6)\030Assess the quality of the siege defences outside the keep (total: 8)\tDurin asked you to count the weapons and armour currently stored inside the keep of Skarháld, as well as to assess the quality of the siege defences on the upper level outside the keep.\n3\tTalk to Durin inside Tharrazhâr, the keep of Skarháld\tDurin is inside Tharrazhâr, the keep of Skarháld.\n4\tSend Zhélruka craftsmen to repair the siege defences ([según el diario]/4)\tDurin has requested that you send Zhélruka craftsmen inside the keep to repair the siege defences.\n5\tThe mountains shake!\tThe mountains shake! What is happening?\n6\tTalk to Durin inside Tharrazhâr, the keep of Skarháld\tDurin is inside Tharrazhâr, the keep of Skarháld, which has been shaken to its foundations.\n7\tThe mountains shake again!\tThe mountains shake! What is happening?\n8\tTalk to Bótuz Frostblood inside Tharrazhâr, the keep of Skarháld\tBótuz Frostblood is inside the keep of Skarháld.\n",
[3301]="7004E6BF\n1\tTalk to Durin inside the keep and defend Skarháld\tBótuz Frostblood wants you to keep an eye on Durin during the defence of Skarháld.\n2\tTalk to Durin on the upper level of Skarháld\tDurin is outside the keep on the upper level of Skarháld.\n3\tHabla con Inek the Brash\tThe death of Bótuz Frostblood threatens to leave the Zhélruka at Skarháld in disarray. One of his lieutenants must rise to lead his fellows.\n4\tTalk to Durin on the upper level of Skarháld\tDurin is outside the keep on the upper level of Skarháld.\n",
[3302]="70059A81\n1\tInvestigate the frozen reaches of Clovengap, to the north-west\tThe northern reaches of Clovengap may have become home to Hrímil Frost-heart, and Bósi wants you to investigate... carefully. He suggested you make your way through Frósthel on the left side of the Ladder-gardens to reach the frozen river-bed.\n2\tExamine the booted footprints in the icy channel\tA disorganized array of Orkish footprints has drawn your attention.\n3\tTalk to Bósi in the south-western portion of Clovengap\tBósi is in the south-west portion of Clovengap, waiting to hear what you learned during your investigation of the frozen reaches.\n4\tTalk to Bróin in Clovengap\tBróin has called for your attention in Clovengap.\n5\tTalk to Bróin atop the terrace to the west, in Clovengap\tBróin asked to meet with you atop the terrace to the west, a short distance away from the others.\n6\tTalk to Bróin and show him the pebble you found in the boot-print\tBróin has asked to see the red pebble you found.\n",
[3303]="70059A82\n1\tCollect blue stones from enemies in Gloomingtarn (total: 3)\030Collect red stones from enemies in Clovengap (total: 3)\030Collect green stones from enemies in Deepscrave (total: 4)\030Collect yellow stones from enemies in the Pit of Stonejaws (total: 5)\030Collect black stones from enemies in Câr Bronach (total: 3)\030Collect white stones from enemies in Máttugard (total: 2)\tBróin has asked you to collect any colourful stones you find from the enemies you face on behalf of the Gabil'akkâ throughout Gundabad.\n2\tBring the pouch of stones to Bróin at Maergrind in Máttugard\tBróin is at Maergrind in Máttugard, eager to see how many stones you were able to find.\n3\tTalk to Durin at Maergrind in Máttugard\tDurin is at Maergrind in Máttugard.\n",
[3304]="70021620\n1\tHabla con Halbarad en Echad Eregion\tHalbarad se encuentra en Echad Eregion. Radanir te ha explicado el plan de Halbarad, que consiste en que Fúni Cortagemas fabrique un anillo de imitación del anillo de Barahir.\n2\tHabla con Halbarad en Echad Eregion y viaja a las forjas\tHalbarad se encuentra en Echad Eregion. Halbarad te espera para viajar contigo a las forjas que Fúni utilizará para fabricar anillos de imitación del anillo de Barahir para la Compañía Gris.\n3\tHabla con Halbarad en Echad Eregion\tHalbarad se encuentra en Echad Eregion, esperando para hablar contigo. Fúni Cortagemas ha fabricado anillos de imitación para la Compañía Gris y ahora deberías hablar con Halbarad.\n",
[3305]="7000F102\n1\tHabla con Bósi y viaja a las Puertas de Durin\tBósi te espera en su pequeño campamento para acompañarte a las Puertas de Durin. Los enanos de Bósi han reparado los picos, y ahora quiere que los lleves con él a los trabajadores.\n2\tHabla con Ráthwald\tRáthwald se encuentra fuera del arco, cerca del campamento de Echad Dúnan, en Eregion. Los enanos se han retirado en desbandada de las Puertas de Durin, y ahora deben planear para un futuro incierto.\n",
[3306]="70014648\n1\tHabla con Bróin\tBróin se está recuperando en la Senda Pacífica, un campamento que se ha establecido a lo largo del Camino de Durin, al noreste de los jardines. Bori está seguro de que Bróin querrá hablar contigo sobre sus aventuras.\n",
[3307]="70025392\n1\tLos estantes que tanto intrigaron a Nár se encuentran en el nivel superior, en el lado norte de la biblioteca aquí, en Zudrugund. Corunir ha señalado los estantes donde Nár pasó tanto tiempo antes del ataque y quiere que busques información útil allí.\t\n2\tHabla con Nár en Zudrugund\tNár está en Zudrugund. Has buscado en los estantes que Corunir te indicó, y deberías hablar con Nár para ver si puede arrojar algo de luz sobre lo que encontraste allí.\n3\tHabla con Corunir en Zudrugund\tCorunir está en Zudrugund. Has hablado con Nár, pero una vez más no te ha dado mucha información con la que puedas encontrar una solución.\n4\tHabla con Halbarad en Lhanuch\tHalbarad se encuentra entre las cabañas al oeste de Lhanuch. Has defendido Zudrugund de los uruks, y Corunir quiere que informes de tu éxito a Halbarad.\n",
[3308]="7001B5CB\n1\tHabla con Issuriel y viaja por Râd Iorist con la Guardia Oculta\tIssuriel está dentro de la bodega de la Posada Embrujada, en los Troncosombríos. Ha llegado el momento de que la Guardia Oculta viaje a través de las Hondonadas Enmarañadas con Mazog. Issuriel espera tu palabra de que estás [según el diario] para comenzar.\n2\tHabla con Achardor en Ost Galadh\tAchardor está en Gadorgar, una sala de almacenamiento dentro de las ruinas de Ost Galadh. El viaje a través de las Hondonadas Enmarañadas resultó desastroso: tanto Mazog como Issuriel han sido envenenados por el letal veneno gwigael. Achardor está furioso y debe ser calmado.\n3\tHabla con Bróin en Ost Galadh\tBróin está en Gadorgar, una sala de almacenamiento dentro de las ruinas de Ost Galadh. Achardor está al límite de su temperamento, y se necesitará mucho para evitar que mate a Mazog en su frustración. Bróin desea razonar con él.\n4\tHabla con Issuriel en Ost Galadh\tIssuriel está en Gadorgar, una sala de almacenamiento dentro de las ruinas de Ost Galadh. Debilitado por los efectos del gwigael, Issuriel tiene algo que decir sobre la misión de la Guardia Oculta.\n",
[3309]="700143DE\n1\tHabla con Bósi en la Cámara de la Encrucijada\tBósi se encuentra en la Cámara de la Encrucijada, en la entrada sur del Camino de Durin, al norte de la Gran Excavación. Brogur te ha pedido que le lleves a Bósi noticias de la victoria de su hijo sobre Ashpar y los orcos de la Mano Blanca en Moria.\n",
[3310]="700147EE\n1\tHabla con Lenglammel y ve a Azanarukâr\tLenglammel se encuentra en su campamento de Gwathrendath, entre las Fundaciones de Piedra. Lenglammel quiere que hables con ella sobre tu viaje a Azanarukâr en busca de Magor y el misterioso mal que habita allí. NOTA: La inspiración te ayudará si decides emprender este desafío. Esta instancia solo se puede completar en solitario o en grupo de dos personas.\n2\tHabla con Lenglammel\tLenglammel se encuentra en su campamento de Gwathrendath, entre las Fundaciones de Piedra. Has ganado una gran victoria en las profundidades bajo Moria, y deberías hablar ahora con Lenglammel.\n",
[3311]="7002099C\n1\tHabla con Corunir en Aughaire\tEl montaraz Corunir está en Aughaire, el asentamiento de los Trev Gallorg en Angmar. Lothrandir te ha dicho dónde podrías encontrar a Corunir, para que pueda ser llamado a la reunión de la Compañía Gris.\n2\tCompleta la escaramuza: Rescate en Nûrz Ghâshu\tEl montaraz Corunir está en Aughaire, el asentamiento de los Trev Gallorg en Angmar. Debes ir con Corunir al peligro si quieres rescatar a Golodir.\n3\tHabla con Corunir en Aughaire\tCorunir está en Aughaire, el asentamiento de los Trev Gallorg, en Angmar. Has rescatado a Golodir de las profundidades de Nûrz Ghâshu y ahora deberías hablar con Corunir, tu aliado en ese viaje.\n",
[3312]="7005A71E\n1\tHabla con el príncipe Ingór\tVérnozal se encuentra en Máttugard, cerca de la Escarpada. El príncipe Ingór desea hablar contigo.\n2\tHabla con el príncipe Ingór\tVérnozal se encuentra en Máttugard, cerca de la Escarpada. El príncipe Ingór desea hablar contigo.\n",
[3313]="70018F11\n1\tHabla con Orvar\tOrvar Martillo de Campana está en Buzun-ghâr, al suroeste de la Senda Pacífica, en la esquina más al sureste de Tharâkh Bazân, por el Camino de Durin. Bróin te ha pedido que hables con el enano Orvar para que te acompañe por el camino secreto hacia Rushdurinul.\n2\tEncuentra la entrada a Zurr-thurkh y úsala para llegar detrás de los muros de Zabadgathol\tLa entrada a Zurr-thurkh, el camino secreto, se encuentra en las profundidades de Buzun-ghâr, donde luchaste contra Grawulun el Caerog. Orvar ha aceptado encontrarse contigo dentro de Zurr-thurkh, si puedes encontrar la entrada, para montar el rescate de Bori de las garras de Mazog.\n3\tHabla con Corunothiel\tCorunothiel está en Lossathrod, el campamento en Buzun-ghâr. Has salido de Rushdurinul victorioso sobre Mazog, pero has recibido la desafortunada noticia de que Bori y los otros cautivos han sido enviados a Dol Guldur con Gorothúl. Corunothiel espera para hablar contigo.\n",
[3314]="70013AFE\n1\tHabla con Brogur\tBrogur está en la Cámara de Liderazgo, una pequeña sala junto a la Sala Vigesimoprimera en Zelem-melek. Brogur ha llevado a una compañía de enanos más al este en Moria, y ha establecido una nueva base de operaciones en la Cámara de Liderazgo, junto a la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\n",
[3315]="7006A87D\n1\tEnter the Meeting-hall of Dâr Laja in the Upper Ward\tThe Meeting-hall of Dâr Laja in the Upper Ward of Umbar Baharbêl has now been opened to the people of the city so they may bring their concerns before the Kindred of the Coins.\n2\tTalk to Daxamat in the entryway of Dâr Laja\tDaxamat stands within the entryway of Dâr Laja.\n3\tTalk to Jajax in the main hall of Dâr Laja\tDaxamat told you his brother Jajax has gone to speak with the Kindred in the main hall of Dâr Laja.\n4\tExamine the suggestions coffer at the foot of Hármelak's dais in Dâr Laja\tJajax is keeping an eye on the coffer containing suggestions for those who might join the leadership of the Kindred of the Coins, and he would like you to do the same.\n5\tAct naturally!\tVigilant guards keep a watchful eye on the suggestions coffer inside Dâr Laja.\n6\tTalk to Hármelak in the main hall of Dâr Laja\tHármelak has called for you to speak with her in the main hall of Dâr Laja.\n",
[3316]="70059A83\n1\tEskil and Trausti are keeping watch over the captive goblin north of Maergrind and down one level, in Máttugard.\t\n2\tTalk to Glúrkub, the captive goblin north of Maergrind\tThe goblin Glúrkub has been imprisoned by the Gabil'akkâ.\n3\tTalk to Trausti north of Maergrind\tTrausti is keeping watch over the captive goblin north of Maergrind.\n4\tThe goblin Glúrkub has given you information concerning the hobgoblin who took Trausti's axe, but can he be trusted? According to Glúrkub, the hobgoblin can be found living in a dwelling south-east of the fortress of Shakhajât.\t\n5\tTalk to Trausti in Shakhajât\tTrausti stands south-east of the fortress of Shakhajât, pleased to have retrieved his axe.\n6\tTalk to Durin north of Maergrind in Máttugard\tDurin is keeping an eye on the captive goblin north of Maergrind and down one level, in Máttugard.\n7\tTalk to the goblin Glúrkub north of Maergrind and down one level, in Máttugard\tThe goblin Glúrkub is encaged north of Maergrind and down one level, in Máttugard.\n",
[3317]="70052715\n1\tDespondent dwarves can be found throughout the upper levels of Skarháld. Durin asked you to speak tales of glory to the dwarves left despondent after the Battle of the First Promise.\t\n2\tTalk to Durin on the upper level of Skarháld\tDurin is on the upper level of Skarháld, waiting to hear if you were able to cure the dwarves of their despondency.\n3\tInek the Brash wishes to speak to you before you fulfil Durin's requests.\t\n4\tBurn bodies of dragonkind at Skarháld (total: 3)\030Collect fallen swords at Skarháld (total: 4)\030Collect the axe Trollsplitter where Bótuz Frostblood dropped it\tThe bodies of drakes and wyrms can be found on the level of Skarháld where Bótuz Frostblood was slain, as can weapons dropped by the defenders of the fortress.\n5\tBring Trollsplitter to Inek the Brash on the upper level of Skarháld\tInek the Brash is on the upper level of Skarháld, waiting for you to return with Trollsplitter.\n6\tTalk to Durin on the upper level of Skarháld\tDurin is on the upper level of Skarháld, waiting for you to return from your task.\n",
[3318]="7005271E\n1\tTalk to Vútro the West-wind in Skarháld\tVútro the West-wind is south-east of Durin and down two levels, among the tents of the Zhélruka in Skarháld.\n2\tTalk to Durin on the upper level of Skarháld\tDurin is on the upper level of Skarháld.\n",
[3319]="7006A87E\n1\tTalk to Khôltekh in the main hall of Dâr Laja\tKhôltekh will wish to speak with you in Dâr Laja.\n2\tFind the entrance to Umbar-môkh that Khôltekh suggested\tKhôltekh told you to go inside the southern entrance to Khabârkhad, where his folk guard an entrance to Umbar-môkh, the caverns and passages beneath Umbar Baharbêl.\n3\tSpeak the password to Mûluget\tMûluget is waiting for you to speak the phrase Khôltekh gave to you.\n4\tSpeak the password to Tekûl down the stairs\tTekûl is further ahead and down the stairs, waiting for you to speak the phrase Khôltekh gave to you.\n5\tSpeak the password to Ayâl through the doors and down the corridor to the north-west\tAyâl is beyond the doors and down the hall to the north-west, waiting for you to speak the phrase Khôltekh gave to you.\n6\tTalk to Birûk in Mekab-kuphâr\tBirûk has been assigned the task of helping you while you are within Umbar-môkh. You will find him to the north-west in Mekab-kuphâr.\n",
[3320]="70059A85\n1\tTalk to the prisoner and experience 'The Divided Loyalties of Glúrkub the Goblin'\tThe goblin Glúrkub wants to tell you his side of the story. He is caged north of Maergrind and down one level, in Máttugard.\n2\tTalk to Glúrkub\tGlúrkub is caged north of Maergrind and down one level, in Máttugard.\n3\tTalk to Durin by the cage\tPrince Durin is furious, enraged with Glúrkub's story.\n",
[3321]="7006A87F\n1\tExamine the notice board to the south-west in Mekab-kuphâr\tBirûk told you to examine the notice board to the south-west in Mekab-kuphâr to see how you can busy yourself while he seeks information concerning Tatháta's whereabouts.\n2\tDefeat wights at Sektakhâb (total: 10)\030Defeat decayed arms at Sektakhâb (total: 3)\030Collect old jewellery from the fingers of wights at Sektakhâb (total: 8)\030Find the axe that was misplaced somewhere at Sektakhâb\tDealing with the wights at Sektakhâb, located to the west of Mekab-kuphâr, may encourage the Temámir to help you.\n3\tDeliver the old jewellery and the axe to the collection box at Mekab-kuphâr\tThe notice board directed you to leave the things you recovered from Sektakhâb in the box back at Mekab-kuphâr.\n4\tLean the axe against the wall by the notice board\tBecause the axe does not fit inside the collection box, you should just lean it against the wall by the notice board.\n5\tTalk to Corudan at Mekab-kuphâr\tCorudan and Sigileth have arrived at Mekab-kuphâr.\n",
[3322]="70059A8C\n1\tKill Glúrkub\tDurin has ordered you to kill the goblin prisoner.\n2\tTalk to Glóin by the cage\tGlóin is standing by the cage, eyeing Durin warily.\n3\tTalk to Durin by the cage\tDurin is furious at the words of Glúrkub and at Glóin's betrayal of his commands.\n4\tTalk to Durin by the cage\tDurin has calmed himself somewhat, but the prince still disbelieves the goblin's story.\n5\tTalk to Glóin by the cage\tGlóin is by the cage in Máttugard.\n6\tTalk to Glúrkub\tGlúrkub is encaged in Máttugard.\n7\tTalk to Durin by the cage\tDurin is by the cage holding Glúrkub.\n",
[3323]="7005271F\n1\tClimb the ladder inside the keep of Skarháld\030Talk to Kámat on the upper level of Tharrazhâr\tDurin asked you to investigate the upper levels of Tharrazhâr, the formerly-inaccessible keep of Skarháld.\n2\tDefeat foes within Tharrazhâr or the crystal tunnels (total: 8)\030Find the entrance to the tunnel in the back of Tharrazhâr\tKámat and Kozun explored the upper level of Tharrazhâr, the keep of Skarháld, and found a tunnel winding deep into the mountain. Kámat asked you to defeat any enemies you find within the chambers of the keep or in the tunnel.\n3\tFind the bottom of the winding tunnel behind Tharrazhâr\030Talk to Kozun at the bottom of the tunnel\tA tunnel winds into the mountains behind Tharrazhâr, the keep of Skarháld, and Kozun went inside to investigate. Kámat has asked you to find his friend and ensure his safety.\n4\tCollapse the cave-mouth at the bottom of the escape tunnel\tKozun has asked for your help in collapsing the cave-mouth at the bottom of the escape tunnel behind Tharrazhâr.\n5\tRocks fall and seal the exit of the escape tunnel\tKozun has asked for your help in collapsing the cave-mouth at the bottom of the escape tunnel behind Tharrazhâr.\n6\tReturn to Durin on the upper level of Skarháld\tYou have successfully collapsed the exit of the escape tunnel, and should now return to Durin on the upper level of Skarháld.\n7\tTalk to Durin on the upper level of Skarháld\tDurin stands on the upper level of Skarháld among a group of new arrivals, including a familiar Wizard.\n",
[3324]="70059A8F\n1\tDefeat Orcs in the Welkin-lofts ([según el diario]/6)\tOrcs prowl the Welkin-lofts, and Durin has asked you to defeat those you find there.\n2\tDefeat Orcs in the Welkin-lofts (5/6)\tOrcs prowl the Welkin-lofts, and Durin has asked you to defeat those you find there.\n3\tFind the path to the summit in the south-east heights of the Welkin-lofts\tThe path to the summit can be found atop a snow-covered terrace in the south-eastern heights of the Welkin-lofts.\n4\tExamine the weapon rack by the path to the summit\tA weapon rack stands by the path to the summit, as Glúrkub described.\n5\tFind a hiding place nearby, perhaps in the stand of trees to the north-west\tYou need to find a hiding place nearby! Perhaps one could be found in the stand of trees to the north-west.\n6\tTalk to Durin by the cage north of Maergrind, in Máttugard\tDurin is north of Maergrind and down one level, by the cage holding Glúrkub in Máttugard.\n7\tTalk to Glúrkub in Máttugard\tGlúrkub is encaged north of Maergrind and down one level, in Máttugard.\n",
[3325]="70052737\n1\tTalk to Gandalf on the upper level of Skarháld\tGandalf has come to Skarháld and stands on the upper level of the fortress.\n",
[3326]="7006A880\n1\tTalk to Birûk at Mekab-kuphâr\tBirûk has returned to Mekab-kuphâr and may have learned something that will help you learn what happened to Tatháta.\n2\tTalk to Corudan at Mekab-kuphâr\tCorudan and Sigileth will want to hear what you learned. They are still at at Mekab-kuphâr, but both of the Elves are eager to depart.\n3\tFind an entrance to the hidden harbour in the south-eastern corner of Dil-irmíz\tAn entrance to the hidden harbour can be found in the south-eastern corner of Dil-irmíz.\n4\tTalk to Sigileth in the hidden harbour\tSigileth stands by the entrance to the hidden harbour, staring out at the docked ships.\n5\tTalk to Corudan in the hidden harbour\tCorudan stands by the entrance to the hidden harbour.\n6\tWait for Corudan to depart\tCorudan hurries away, his feet making little sound on either wood or rock.\n7\tDefeat devious Corsairs in the hidden harbour (total: 10)\030Defeat Heirsworn captains in the hidden harbour (total: 3)\tDevious Corsairs and their Heirsworn Captains have taken over the hidden harbour in Nakási's absence, and you should keep them busy while Corudan searches Tatháta's ship for some clue to her whereabouts.\n8\tTalk to Corudan by the entrance of the hidden harbour\tCorudan has returned to the entrance of the hidden harbour, but whether he found anything of use remains in doubt.\n9\tReturn to Mekab-kuphâr and ask Birûk about the map Corudan recovered\tCorudan and Sigileth suggested that you return to Mekab-kuphâr and ask Birûk what he thinks of the circled areas on the map Corudan retrieved from Tatháta's ship.\n10\tTalk to Corudan at Mekab-kuphâr\tCorudan and Sigileth have arrived at Mekab-kuphâr.\n",
[3327]="70059AC5\n1\tTalk to Glúrkub and travel with him to the Welkin-lofts\tGlúrkub is encaged north of Maergrind and down one level, in Máttugard, prepared to undertake his end of the bargain.\n2\tTalk to Durin at Maergrind, in Máttugard\tDurin is at Maergrind, the Noble Gate, having fulfilled his end of the agreement with Glúrkub.\n",
[3328]="7006A881\n1\tFind someone at Mekab-kuphâr who might know what happened to Birûk\tCorudan suggested that you ask dwarves at Mekab-kuphâr if any of them saw where Birûk might have gone.\n2\tExamine the notice board at Mekab-kuphâr\tGêzheg does not know where Birûk has gone, but he did notice the dwarf studying the notice board at some point in the last few hours.\n3\tTalk to Corudan at Mekab-kuphâr\tCorudan will want to hear what you think might have happened to Birûk. The Elf has returned to Mekab-kuphâr with Sigileth.\n4\tSearch for Birûk at Nishabêt or Lôkhalel\tYou believe Birûk has gone to complete one of the two tasks posted on the notice board, either to combat the spiders of Nishabêt to the north, or to face the grave-robbers of Lôkhalel to the north-west. Whichever of the locations you do not search will be visited by Corudan and Sigileth.\n5\tYou located Birûk, but he needs your help!\t\n6\tWait for Birûk to escape\tBirûk flees for safety!\n7\tTalk to Birûk at Itekh-kên in the northern reaches of Khabârkhad\tBirûk said he would meet you at Itekh-kên, in the northern reaches of Khabârkhad.\n",
})
